2026-08-18T22:22:52.8322451Z > # CI. Skipped on CRAN (skip_on_cran = TRUE) because it depends on the system
2026-08-18T22:22:52.8322544Z > # hunspell dictionary.
2026-08-18T22:22:52.8322619Z > #
2026-08-18T22:22:52.8322826Z > # To switch to enforcement (error = TRUE), first run spelling::update_wordlist()
2026-08-18T22:22:52.8323028Z > # locally (needs hunspell) to populate inst/WORDLIST with every current term,
2026-08-18T22:22:52.8323205Z > # then flip error = TRUE. DESCRIPTION uses `Language: en-GB` because the
2026-08-18T22:22:52.8323671Z > # package prose uses British spellings (behaviour, colour, modelling, ...), and
